include LICENSE LICENSE.ru.md README.md SECURITY.md CONTRIBUTING.md CHANGELOG.md RELEASE_NOTES.md requirements-build.txt
include *.md
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include fixtures *.json
recursive-include schemas *.json
